 fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-warm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#4A3020\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"4\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"20\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.34\" cy=\"6.34\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.66\" cy=\"17.66\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.34\" cy=\"17.66\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.66\" cy=\"6.34\" r=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle></svg><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-amber-warm/40\"></span></div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-amber-light font-medium\">Rooftop Café &amp; Dining</p><h1 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-cream-soft font-serif\">Welcome to D Den Corner</h1><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-stone\">Where dark architectural metal meets warm amber light, open-air breezes, lush greenery, and flavorful artisanal cuisine.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-warm px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-charcoal-black transition hover:bg-amber-light shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/menu\"><span>Explore Our Menu</span><span>→</span></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-stone/30 bg-charcoal-green/50 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-cream-soft transition hover:bg-charcoal-green\" href=\"/orders\"><span>Running Orders</span></a></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 checker-strip-subtle opacity-30\"></div></section><section class=\"px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 sm:py-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone/40 bg-cream-soft p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"h-4 w-4 animate-spin rounded-full border-2 border-stone border-t-amber-warm\"></div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-charcoal-deep/70\">Checking your table session...</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 pt-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone/40 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-charcoal-deep text-amber-light mb-3\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-charcoal-deep font-serif\">Open-Air Rooftop</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-charcoal-deep/70 leading-relaxed\">Relax under warm hanging lanterns with gentle open skies and garden vibes.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone/40 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-forest-dark text-amber-light mb-3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-amber-light\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 22C12 22 11.5 14 17 9C19 7 21 6 21 6C21 6 20 8 18 10C15 13 14 17 14 22\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M12 18C12 18 9 14 9 10C9 6.5 11 3 12 2C13 3 15 6.5 15 10C15 14 12 18 12 18Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22C12 22 12.5 14 7 9C5 7 3 6 3 6C3 6 4 8 6 10C9 13 10 17 10 22\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-charcoal-deep font-serif\">Crafted Dishes</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-charcoal-deep/70 leading-relaxed\">Fresh ingredients, regional specialties, festival creations, and café classics.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-stone/40 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-wood-dark text-amber-light mb-3\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-charcoal-deep font-serif\">Warm Hospitality</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-charcoal-deep/70 leading-relaxed\">Table-side contactless service directly connected to our kitchen team.</p></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"mt-12 border-t border-stone/40 bg-charcoal-deep py-6 text-center text-xs text-stone\"><div class=\"checker-strip-subtle opacity-20 mb-6\"></div><p class=\"font-serif text-cream-soft font-semibold\">D DEN CORNER</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-stone/70\">Dark Rooftop Café &amp; Warm Hospitality</p></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1jhkf36dtf9c-.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[73672,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/42p10w91kiamn.js\\\"],\\\"CustomerSessionProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[21473,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/42p10w91kiamn.js\\\"],\\\"CartProvider\\\"]\\n4:I[74331,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/42p10w91kiamn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[2722,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/42p10w91kiamn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[77623,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/42p10w91kiamn.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[23060,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/42p10w91kiamn.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/24hne0j_glq5i.js\\\"],\\\"default\\